**************************************
p-y+M-theta model: p-y curves for D=9-su=NaN+NaNz
This file is specified for the py curves of the NREL 5 MW monopile wind turbine
The first 5 lines are comments
**************************************
45            -NumDataSets		- Number of the data sets,i.e. the number of locations that contains p-y curve.
103              -NumPnts		- the number of the points defined for the curve (must >=4)
30            - PlasticIndex
0.2            - Loading_frequency
100            -N
1            - OCR
6            - Gamma        -effective soil weight
270            - SigmaRotation        -the effective soil stress at the pile rotation point
1            - Damping_index         -0 denotes without the consideration of damping, 1 denotes with the consideration of damping
